      "amount": "1/2 cup",
      "notes": "pitted"
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oven to 300 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "Heat the olive oil in the ceramic tagine over medium heat.",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until it is caramelized and golden brown.",
    "Add the minced garlic and grated ginger and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the lamb pieces and cook until they are browned on all sides.",
    "Add the ground cumin, coriander, and cinnamon, and cook for 1 minute.",
    "Add the honey, prunes, and wholegrain bread cubes, and stir to combine.",
    "Cover the tagine and transfer it to the preheated oven.",
    "Bake for 2.5 hours, or until the lamb is tender and the bread is crispy.",
    "Serve the tagine hot, garnished with fresh herbs if desired."
  ],
